  "notes_for_editor": "Thin sources: the two lookout-history pages repeat the same dates, and the Forest Fire Lookout Association table only confirms the tower is gone. County conflict left unresolved: firelookout.com says Boundary County, while the FFLA table and our record say Bonner. Elevation 6,371 ft (about 1,942 m) is in firelookout.com but elevation_m is empty in the record. Staffing is one name for 1933 and is not dated as first or last. The L-4 design background comes from the University of Idaho Keeping Watch page, not from a Jeru-specific source. Two searches found no other source, and no photo. Idaho Fire Lookouts' 'Hike-in' tag is historical access only; no visit facts were written. Fact-check 2026-10-10: the 1934 and 1955 dates are now also quoted from Idaho Fire Lookouts (cite 2). The story's L-4 sentence paraphrases Keeping Watch instead of repeating its wording.",
